**S6 — `navItems.test.ts` will go red the moment a nav item is added (phase 5).** It asserts `NAV_ITEMS.map(n => n.key)` equals an exact five-element array, under a test named "exposes exactly the five primary destinations". Phase 5 must update both the array and the test name in the same commit. This is expected, not a regression.

